# ComputeIK action
# Goal: target end-effector pose
# Result: joint angles + convergence status + final error
# Feedback: progress during IK computation

geometry_msgs/Pose target_pose
---
float64[] joint_positions
bool success
float64 position_error
float64 orientation_error
---
float64 current_position_error
float64 current_orientation_error
int32 iteration
